 ### Typed path (`src/jit/typed_compiler.rs`)
+
+**Correctness guard (2026-09-08):** typed guard stripping is currently
+restricted to straight-line regions. Regions containing `Jmp`/`JmpT`/`JmpF`
+fall back to the scalar JIT because the current typed codegen evolves one
+`TypeMetadata` value in lexical bytecode order; that is not a sound substitute
+for the per-PC CFG facts required at loop backedges and branch joins. Restore
+typed control-flow compilation only after codegen accepts per-PC metadata and
+the differential control-flow regressions stay green.
